  "definition": "Role and Responsibilities of the Area Agency",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-12-29",
  "historyNote": "#1647, eff 10-14-80; ss by #2020, eff 5-11-82; ss by #2678, eff 4-18-84; ss by #4667, eff 8-25-89; ss by #4729, eff 1-15-90, EXPIRED: 1-15-96 New. #6871, eff 10-21-98; amd by #8443, eff 1-1-06; amd by #8728, INTERIM, eff 10-21-06, EXPIRED: 4-19-07 New. #8928, eff 6-30-07; ss by #10916, eff 8-26-15; ss by #13842, eff 12-29-23",
